msgid "Couldn't activate disable function of WPSCAN because of no permission to write htaccess file."
msgstr "Impossible d'activer la fonction de desactivation de WPSCAN car il n'y a pas de permission pour ecrire le fichier htaccess."

msgid "Couldn't activate Track Trace function because of no permission to write htaccess file."
